OL,3,AWhat happened in the failed execution
OL,4,Aof Christa Pike - and what next?
OL,5,
OL,6,FPike, now 50, was sentenced to death in
OL,7,F1996 for the murder a year earlier of
OL,8,F19-year-old Colleen Slemmer.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
