OL,3,ANetanyahu says Flydubai attacker had
OL,4,A'Islamist radical indoctrination'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIsraeli Prime Minister Benjamin
OL,7,FNetanyahu says investigations suggest
OL,8,Fthe man who stabbed his fellow pilot
OL,9,Fand tried to take over a flight from
OL,10,FDubai to Tel Aviv had undergone
OL,11,F"Islamist radical indoctrination".
OL,13,FThe Flydubai plane plunged more than
OL,14,F17,000ft (5,200m) two hours into its
OL,15,Fjourney on Wednesday, before passengers
OL,16,Fand crew overpowered the attacker and
OL,17,Fretook control to land safely.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
