OL,3,APutin warns West that Russia is ready
OL,4,Ato use every weapon to protect
OL,5,AKaliningrad
OL,6,
OL,7,FVladimir Putin has said Russia will use
OL,8,Fall weapons at his disposal if it
OL,9,Fconsiders its Baltic exclave of
OL,10,FKaliningrad to have come under direct
OL,11,Fattack.
OL,13,FThe Russian president insisted that
OL,14,FMoscow was "not threatening anyone" and
OL,15,Fmerely responding to statements by
OL,16,FWestern leaders that it was preparing
OL,17,Ffor war in 2029 or 2030.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
