OL,3,APutin warns West that Russia is ready
OL,4,Ato use every weapon to protect
OL,5,AKaliningrad
OL,6,
OL,7,FThroughout this week, Russia has
OL,8,Faccused Nato of preparing to blockade
OL,9,Fits territory, which borders Lithuania
OL,10,Fand Poland, warning that it would even
OL,11,Fbe prepared to use nuclear weapons if
OL,12,Fthe West tried to cut off Kaliningrad
OL,13,Ffrom the rest of Russia.
OL,15,FNato has sought to calm the situation,
OL,16,Fstressing that it was a defensive
OL,17,Falliance and urging Moscow to stop its
OL,18,F"nuclear threats".
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
